    "body": "Assigning `ToIntegral<int64_t>(\"-1\")` to the `optional<uint64_t>` `n` is a silent underflow. `BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL` then promotes `int` to `uint64_t`, which also underflows. The correct check is to re-declare `n`. Part of clean up in #35587\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>gdb before/after</summary>\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n```\r\n(gdb) next\r\n886\t    n = ToIntegral<int64_t>(\"-1\", 16);\r\n1: n = {<std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true>> = {<std::_Optional_base_impl<unsigned long, std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true> >> = {<No data fields>}, _M_payload = {<std::_Optional_payload_base<unsigned long>> = {_M_payload = {\r\n          _M_empty = {<No data fields>}, _M_value = 18446744073709551615},\r\n        _M_engaged = true}, <No data fields>}}, <std::_Enable_copy_move<true, true, true, true, std::optional<unsigned long> >> = {<No data fields>}, <No data fields>}\r\n2: n = {<std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true>> = {<std::_Optional_base_impl<unsigned long, std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true> >> = {<No data fields>}, _M_payload = {<std::_Optional_payload_base<unsigned long>> = {_M_payload = {\r\n          _M_empty = {<No data fields>}, _M_value = 18446744073709551615},\r\n        _M_engaged = true}, <No data fields>}}, <std::_Enable_copy_move<true, true, true, true, std::optional<unsigned long> >> = {<No data fields>}, <No data fields>}\r\n(gdb) next\r\n887\t    BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL(*n, -1);\r\n1: n = {<std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true>> = {<std::_Optional_base_impl<unsigned long, std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true> >> = {<No data fields>}, _M_payload = {<std::_Optional_payload_base<unsigned long>> = {_M_payload = {\r\n          _M_empty = {<No data fields>}, _M_value = 18446744073709551615},\r\n        _M_engaged = true}, <No data fields>}}, <std::_Enable_copy_move<true, true, true, true, std::optional<unsigned long> >> = {<No data fields>}, <No data fields>}\r\n2: n = {<std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true>> = {<std::_Optional_base_impl<unsigned long, std::_Optional_base<unsigned long, true, true> >> = {<No data fields>}, _M_payload = {<std::_Optional_payload_base<unsigned long>> = {_M_payload = {\r\n          _M_empty = {<No data fields>}, _M_value = 18446744073709551615},\r\n        _M_engaged = true}, <No data fields>}}, <std::_Enable_copy_move<true, true, true, true, std::optional<unsigned long> >> = {<No data fields>}, <No data fields>}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n```\r\n(gdb) n\r\n887\t    BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL(*signed_n, -1);\r\n(gdb) print signed_n\r\n$2 = {<std::_Optional_base<long, true, true>> = {<std::_Optional_base_impl<long, std::_Optional_base<long, true, true> >> = {<No data fields>}, _M_payload = {<std::_Optional_payload_base<long>> = {_M_payload = {_M_empty = {<No data fields>}, _M_value = -1},\r\n        _M_engaged = true}, <No data fields>}}, <std::_Enable_copy_move<true, true, true, true, std::optional<long> >> = {<No data fields>}, <No data fields>}\r\n```\r\n</details>",
