      "message": "test: Redeclare variable as signed in `util_tests`\n\nAssigning `ToIntegral<int64_t>(\"-1\")` to the `optional<uint64_t>` `n`\nis a silent underflow. `BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL` then promotes `int` to\n`uint64_t`, which also underflows. The correct check is to re-declare\n`n`.",
